---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="About StackPick Lab and how we create comparisons.">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">About StackPick Lab</h1>
  <div class="prose-spl mt-6 max-w-3xl">
    <p>
      StackPick Lab helps solopreneurs and small marketing teams choose AI writing and SEO tools without hype.
      We focus on tradeoffs: price, workflow fit, and when a cheaper tool (or no second tool) is the right call.
    </p>
    <h2>How content is made</h2>
    <p>
      Articles and comparisons are <strong>research-based</strong>: public pricing pages, feature docs, and common
      operator workflows. We do <em>not</em> invent long personal trial narratives.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>AI-assisted content:</strong> We use AI tools to help outline, draft, and edit. Every money page is
      reviewed for accuracy, disclosure, and a clear “Best for / Skip if” recommendation. AI does not replace
      editorial judgment.
    </p>
    <h2>Business model</h2>
    <p>
      We may earn commissions from affiliate links. That never obligates a positive review. See
      <a href="/disclosure">Affiliate disclosure</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
